diation":"Allow the locale/place label to be selected based on user preference, or document that this skill is intentionally region-specific for Bulgarian Facebook geotagging and why that constraint is required.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"examples/facebook-geotag.json","start_line":19,"end_line":19}]},{"id":"SQP-3","finding_id":"finding-65dfd1c4647a485797775f6a3881b2a3","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.91,"location":{"file":"examples/instagram-geotag.json","start_line":19,"end_line":19},"finding":null,"explanation":"The value for `instagramLocationName` is provided only in Bulgarian/Cyrillic, which can impose a specific language/locale on downstream behavior or user-visible output. In this file there is no indication that the locale is user-selected or that the skill is intentionally region-specific.","remediation":"Allow the user to choose the display language/locale, or document that this skill is explicitly intended for a Bulgarian region/context. If the value is only an internal identifier label, clarify that in surrounding documentation or use a locale-neutral field alongside the localized name.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"examples/instagram-geotag.json","start_line":19,"end_line":19}]},{"id":"SDI-1","finding_id":"finding-55b6700fad184802be5281f7cff80d14","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.93,"location":{"file":"examples/post-analytics.json","start_line":2,"end_line":4},"finding":null,"explanation":"The manifest describes scheduling, managing, publishing, deleting, commenting, and account-connection workflows, but it does not mention analytics or performance metric retrieval. This example explicitly fetches analytics for published posts, which is an additional behavior beyond the stated manifest scope.","remediation":"Update the manifest description to explicitly include social post analytics/reporting capabilities, or remove analytics examples/endpoints from the skill if they are not intended to be part of the skill's supported scope.","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"examples/post-analytics.json","start_line":2,"end_line":4}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-9b748543e4ec467d9b8450356882a3ae","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.84,"location":{"file":"references/api-reference.md","start_line":381,"end_line":391},"finding":null,"explanation":"Although the section explains what DELETE /social-posts/:id does, it does not present the operation as a user warning or caution despite deleting posts, schedules, analytics, and potentially media files. For markdown documentation, destructive behavior affecting user data should be called out explicitly so users do not treat it as a routine read-only API call.","remediation":"Add a short warning banner or note in this section, such as 'Warning: this permanently removes the post from PostFast, including schedule and analytics, and may delete media when no longer referenced.'","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/api-reference.md","start_line":381,"end_line":391}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-9d9751d6fd2540aaadf14c5fb1db641d","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.82,"location":{"file":"references/platform-controls.md","start_line":41,"end_line":41},"finding":null,"explanation":"The description states that the label cannot be removed after publishing, which is an irreversible action affecting published content. However, it is presented as a parameter note rather than a clear user warning about permanence and the need to confirm intent before using it.","remediation":"Add an explicit warning label in the description, for example: 'Warning: this setting is permanent for the published post and cannot be removed afterward.'","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/platform-controls.md","start_line":41,"end_line":41}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-5650ae5a4e9944a79b2af36116eb169d","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.87,"location":{"file":"references/platform-controls.md","start_line":63,"end_line":63},"finding":null,"explanation":"This markdown file documents a behavior that can materially affect who can see posted content, which impacts user reach and publication expectations. Although the effect is described, there is no explicit warning-style disclosure calling out the visibility risk or advising careful use.","remediation":"Add an explicit warning near `facebookTargetCountries`, such as 'Warning: this restricts visibility to selected countries and hides the post from everyone else, including logged-out users; use only when intentional.'","code_snippet":null,"intent":null,"tags":["llm-unconfirmed"],"evidence":{},"match_fingerprint":null,"occurrences":[{"file":"references/platform-controls.md","start_line":63,"end_line":63}]},{"id":"SQP-2","finding_id":"finding-a7761ade408148f2bc68b5b33bc1f82e","category":null,"pattern":null,"severity":"LOW","confidence":0.8,"location":{"file":"references/platform-controls.md","start_line":89,"end_line":89},"finding":null,"explanation":"This parameter controls a disclosure label related to synthetic content and is only settable at creation time, making mistakes difficult to correct later. The documentation states the constraint, but it does not clearly warn users about the irreversible publishing impact of choosing the wrong value.","remediation":"Add a warning such as 'Warning: this disclosure can only be set when creating the post; verify the value before publishing because it cannot be change